{
  "format": "ziffr.pack/2",
  "id": "ziffr/finance",
  "name": "Finance",
  "version": "1.2.0",
  "summary": "Revenue, cost of goods sold, operating costs, cash and invoices, with gross margin and net result worked out, a monthly dashboard and a close Workflow that locks the month.",
  "author": {
    "name": "Ziffr"
  },
  "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
  "ziffr": ">=0.11",
  "audience": {
    "functions": [
      "finance"
    ]
  },
  "listing": {
    "homepage": "https://github.com/ziffr/ziffr/tree/main/packs"
  },
  "guide": {
    "whatItsFor": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "For closing the month: revenue, costs, the margin and result they leave, cash in the bank and the money still to be collected."
      }
    ],
    "beforeYouStart": [
      {
        "type": "list",
        "items": [
          "The person who sends the month's figures and the person who approves unusual ones.",
          "Revenue, cost of goods sold, operating costs, cash and the open and overdue invoices.",
          "Free room for the Metrics in your Workspace's size: the Set up form says how many it makes and how many fit."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "firstSteps": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "Start here"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "numbered": true,
        "items": [
          "Open **Settings**, then **Packs**. Under this Pack, choose **Set up from this Pack**.",
          "Keep the Metrics you want ticked, up to all 8, with the dashboard **Finance monthly** and the Workflow **Monthly finance close**. Tick **Ask me for their values** if you send the figures yourself, then choose **Set up**.",
          "Pick the **Approver** the Workflow asks for before you choose **Set up**.",
          "If someone else sends figures, do this right after Set up: open the **Setup Guide** from **Help**, choose **Team**, and under **Who is asked for what** pick the person for each Metric and press **Ask**. It lists your ten newest Metrics.",
          "Send the first figures: answer the request Ziffr sends, or open a Metric you submit and choose **Record a value**.",
          "Open **Dashboards** and then **Finance monthly**. It fills as values come in."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "eachPart": [
      {
        "type": "list",
        "items": [
          "You send **Revenue**, **Cost of goods sold**, **Operating costs**, **Cash balance**, **Open invoices** and **Overdue invoices**.",
          "Ziffr works out **Gross margin**, revenue less the cost of goods sold as a share of revenue, and **Net result**, revenue less both costs.",
          "The dashboard **Finance monthly**.",
          "The Workflow **Monthly finance close**: due on the fifth working day, checked, unusual values approved, then locked. A figure that is still missing after its Due Date is raised with the Metric's owner."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "questions": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "Which values need an approval?"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Those the check marks as unusual: a change of more than 30 % or a value outside its target. Change the Approve step to **Every value** to approve all."
      }
    ]
  },
  "contents": {
    "metrics": [
      {
        "key": "revenue",
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "Revenue",
          "description": "Revenue recognised in the month, excluding VAT.",
          "category": "Finance",
          "period": "month",
          "aggregation": "sum",
          "polarity": "higher",
          "unit": "€",
          "unitPosition": "after",
          "valueFormat": "currency",
          "decimals": 0,
          "submissionRule": "overwrite",
          "sources": [
            "web_form",
            "mail",
            "slack",
            "telegram",
            "api"
          ],
          "tags": [
            "Finance",
            "Revenue",
            "Monthly report",
            "Board"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "cogs",
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "Cost of goods sold",
          "description": "What it cost to deliver what was sold in the month: materials, delivery and direct labour.",
          "category": "Finance",
          "period": "month",
          "aggregation": "sum",
          "polarity": "lower",
          "unit": "€",
          "unitPosition": "after",
          "valueFormat": "currency",
          "decimals": 0,
          "submissionRule": "overwrite",
          "sources": [
            "web_form",
            "mail",
            "slack",
            "telegram",
            "api"
          ],
          "tags": [
            "Finance"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "operating-costs",
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "Operating costs",
          "description": "Running costs of the business in the month, apart from the cost of goods sold: staff, rent, software, marketing.",
          "category": "Finance",
          "period": "month",
          "aggregation": "sum",
          "polarity": "lower",
          "unit": "€",
          "unitPosition": "after",
          "valueFormat": "currency",
          "decimals": 0,
          "submissionRule": "overwrite",
          "sources": [
            "web_form",
            "mail",
            "slack",
            "telegram",
            "api"
          ],
          "tags": [
            "Finance",
            "Monthly report"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "cash",
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "Cash balance",
          "description": "Money in the bank at month end.",
          "category": "Finance",
          "period": "month",
          "aggregation": "last",
          "polarity": "higher",
          "unit": "€",
          "unitPosition": "after",
          "valueFormat": "currency",
          "decimals": 0,
          "submissionRule": "overwrite",
          "sources": [
            "web_form",
            "mail",
            "slack",
            "telegram",
            "api"
          ],
          "tags": [
            "Finance",
            "Board"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "open-invoices",
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "Open invoices",
          "description": "The value of invoices sent and not yet paid, at month end.",
          "category": "Finance",
          "period": "month",
          "aggregation": "last",
          "polarity": "lower",
          "unit": "€",
          "unitPosition": "after",
          "valueFormat": "currency",
          "decimals": 0,
          "submissionRule": "overwrite",
          "sources": [
            "web_form",
            "mail",
            "slack",
            "telegram",
            "api"
          ],
          "tags": [
            "Finance"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "overdue-invoices",
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "Overdue invoices",
          "description": "The value of invoices past their due date and not paid, at month end.",
          "category": "Finance",
          "period": "month",
          "aggregation": "last",
          "polarity": "lower",
          "unit": "€",
          "unitPosition": "after",
          "valueFormat": "currency",
          "decimals": 0,
          "submissionRule": "overwrite",
          "sources": [
            "web_form",
            "mail",
            "slack",
            "telegram",
            "api"
          ],
          "tags": [
            "Finance",
            "Board"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "gross-margin",
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "Gross margin",
          "description": "Revenue less the cost of goods sold, as a share of revenue.",
          "category": "Finance",
          "period": "month",
          "aggregation": "none",
          "polarity": "higher",
          "unit": "%",
          "unitPosition": "after",
          "valueFormat": "percent",
          "decimals": 0,
          "formula": "({revenue} - {cogs}) / {revenue} * 100",
          "tags": [
            "Finance",
            "Monthly report"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "net-result",
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "Net result",
          "description": "Revenue less the cost of goods sold and the operating costs, in the month.",
          "category": "Finance",
          "period": "month",
          "aggregation": "none",
          "polarity": "higher",
          "unit": "€",
          "unitPosition": "after",
          "valueFormat": "currency",
          "decimals": 0,
          "formula": "{revenue} - {cogs} - {operating-costs}",
          "tags": [
            "Finance",
            "Board"
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "dashboards": [
      {
        "key": "finance-monthly",
        "template": {
          "format": "ziffr.dashboard-template/1",
          "name": "Finance monthly",
          "description": "Revenue, margin and the result it leaves, the cash in the bank, and the money still to be collected.",
          "slots": [
            {
              "label": "Revenue",
              "suggests": "revenue"
            },
            {
              "label": "Gross margin",
              "suggests": "gross-margin"
            },
            {
              "label": "Net result",
              "suggests": "net-result"
            },
            {
              "label": "Cash balance",
              "suggests": "cash"
            },
            {
              "label": "Operating costs",
              "suggests": "operating-costs"
            },
            {
              "label": "Overdue invoices",
              "suggests": "overdue-invoices"
            }
          ],
          "widgets": [
            {
              "view": "number",
              "slots": [
                0
              ],
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "w": 3,
              "h": 4
            },
            {
              "view": "gauge",
              "slots": [
                1
              ],
              "x": 3,
              "y": 0,
              "w": 3,
              "h": 4
            },
            {
              "view": "number",
              "slots": [
                2
              ],
              "x": 6,
              "y": 0,
              "w": 3,
              "h": 4
            },
            {
              "view": "number",
              "slots": [
                3
              ],
              "x": 9,
              "y": 0,
              "w": 3,
              "h": 4
            },
            {
              "view": "line",
              "slots": [
                0
              ],
              "x": 0,
              "y": 4,
              "w": 8,
              "h": 6,
              "settings": {
                "window": 12
              }
            },
            {
              "view": "number",
              "slots": [
                5
              ],
              "x": 8,
              "y": 4,
              "w": 4,
              "h": 6
            },
            {
              "view": "bars",
              "slots": [
                4
              ],
              "x": 0,
              "y": 10,
              "w": 12,
              "h": 6,
              "settings": {
                "window": 12
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "workflows": [
      {
        "key": "monthly-finance-close",
        "template": {
          "format": "ziffr.workflow-template/1",
          "name": "Monthly finance close",
          "description": "The month's figures are due on the fifth working day, checked, approved by one person, then locked.",
          "dueWorkingDays": 5,
          "steps": [
            {
              "type": "remind",
              "daysBefore": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "escalate",
              "to": "owner",
              "daysAfter": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "check",
              "changePct": 30,
              "outsideTarget": true
            },
            {
              "type": "approve",
              "approvers": 1,
              "values": "unusual"
            },
            {
              "type": "publish",
              "lock": true
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "feeds": [
    {
      "template": "google-sheets",
      "fills": [
        "revenue",
        "cogs",
        "operating-costs"
      ]
    },
    {
      "template": "excel",
      "fills": [
        "cash",
        "open-invoices",
        "overdue-invoices"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
